  Lines:
    Loved:
    - 'Oh, for me? You shouldn''t have. I won''t forget this.'
    - 'Now that is a kindness. You''ve made my whole day.'
    Liked:
    - 'That''s good of you. Thank you.'
    - 'Well now, I''ll put that to good use. Thank you.'
    Neutral:
    - 'Thank you kindly.'
    - 'That''s thoughtful of you. Thank you.'
    Disliked:
    - 'Oh. Well. It''s the thought that counts, isn''t it.'
    - 'Ah. Thank you, I suppose. I''ll find a use for it.'
    NotGiftable:
    - 'Oh, I couldn''t take that from you. You''ll be needing it.'
    AlreadyGiftedToday:
    - 'You''ve been too good to me already today. Keep that one for yourself.'
